# Vivado live project is recreatable from RevisionControl — ignore everything in
# vivado_proj/ except the revision-control export (git cannot re-include under a
# fully ignored parent dir, hence the /* + negation pattern)
vivado_proj/*
!vivado_proj/RevisionControl/

# Vivado session junk at repo root
/vivado*.jou
/vivado*.log
.Xil/
